notes: Closed. LiveEntry.process_event no longer returns Event because a target_id sits in templates. Every opened frame still runs collect-all Admit then Apply, and an unknown action_path on a template target is Deny. CI fails if process_event returns Event solely because the template set holds that id. Out of scope: hangar tools.
acceptance: An event whose target_id is in templates still runs collect-all Admit then Apply. Unknown action_path on a template target is Deny. CI fails if process_event returns Event solely because templates.contains(target_id). nla-policy-scan gate coding-completion and project-completion-bac on AEP-Components/live-entry/crate before any ship prose.
